> Pocket DoJa Pocket DoJa No installed games\nUse the top-right menu to Import .JAM Search Pocket DoJa is an Android-based emulator project based on OpenDoJa, dedicated to exploring and preserving the experience of classic NTT DoCoMo i-mode Java games. PayPal: Wallet address:
Donations are entirely optional and help support ongoing development and preservation efforts.
Thank you for your interest in Pocket DoJa!
